{title: Victory is mine}
{x_theme: prayer, victory}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/Victory is mine.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
Victory is mine, victory is mine
Victory today is mine
I told satan get thee behind
Victory today is mine

{comment: Verse 1}
When I woke this morning, I had no doubt
I knew that the Lord would bring me out
I got down on my knees and cried Lord help me please
Got up singing and shouting the victory

{comment: Verse 2}
If the devil’s got you bound, he’s running you around
And you feel that you will never win
Let me tell you what to do, just pray till you pray through
And you will have the victory again
